~ start

father: There you are. Any luck with a job today?
kid: I'm still looking, Dad. Give me a break.

father: A break? You've been "looking" for months.
kid: I'll start applying today. For real.

father: One week. Find work in one week, or you're out of this house.
kid: You're kicking me out?!

father: This isn't a hotel.
kid: But where would I go?

father: Somewhere that pays you. Problem solved.
kid: That's... actually kind of inspiring.

father: Don't get clever. And don't ask me for money.
kid: Could I borrow some to print my CV?

father: GET OUT!
kid: ...Computer, here I come.

=> END!
